.TP
.B top \-bn1
Print one batch-mode iteration and exit. Useful for scripting and
periodic snapshots.
.TP
.B top \-p 1234,5678
Monitor only the processes with PIDs 1234 and 5678.
.TP
.B top \-u alice
Show only processes owned by user \fIalice\fR.
.TP
.B top \-d 1
Refresh every second instead of the default 3-second interval.
